    <p>With a passion for real estate and years of experience in sales and negotiation, Rajivan ensures every client gets top-tier service. Call him today to see how he can help you navigate the real estate market with confidence.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg mt-32">Let's Connect</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>